WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.966
A tarot deck has 78 cards: 22 major arcana for big
themes and 56 minor arcana for everyday life.

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:13.409
The major arcana: 22 cards.

00:00:13.409 --> 00:00:17.536
The major arcana are 22 cards numbered
from 0 to 21.

00:00:17.536 --> 00:00:23.410
They begin with The Fool, numbered 0, and
end with The World, numbered 21.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.868
The minor arcana: 56 cards.

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:33.023
The minor arcana are the 56 cards that
look most like a regular playing deck.

00:00:34.423 --> 00:00:36.774
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:36.774 --> 00:00:41.540
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
